      "writtenOn": "2024-08-01T13:10:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Another alternative to all this is we remove the BindGroup caching from Graphite entirely and instead have Dawn cache them. Is there something that is blocking Dawn from just have a cache of them it can returning one when you ask to create a new one?",
      "parentUuid": "0953c0f6_0afabbb2",
      "revId": "f6d3f83e407a738f7eba91e3be06f3b74de638ad",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
