      "writtenOn": "2024-08-01T13:07:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This either seems unnecessary or inefficient. There is already an issue if two different resourceProviders are used then the assert will not trigger (different singleOwner objects) but we\u0027ll still have thread issues with the binding cache.\n\nFirst we could find a way to make sure this is only ever called from the Context thread and guarantee that the resourceProvider here is always that of the Context\u0027s. This approach could lead to some ugly APIs but probably is doable.\n\nAlternatively we just need to make access to this function thread safe.",
